        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"model\": \"llama-3.3-70b-versatile\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"system\",\n      \"content\": \"You are a professional travel itinerary planner. Create practical, realistic and personalized travel itineraries. Respect the customer's budget, interests, travel duration, accommodation preference and transportation preference.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"Create a personalized travel itinerary using these details:\\n\\nCustomer: {{ $json.customer_name }}\\nDestination: {{ $json.destination }}\\nTravel date: {{ $json.travel_date }}\\nTrip duration: {{ $json.travel_duration }} days\\nNumber of travelers: {{ $json.travelers }}\\nBudget: ₹{{ $json.budget }}\\nInterests: {{ $json.interests }}\\nTemperature forecast: {{ $json.temperature_min }}°C - {{ $json.temperature_max }}°C\\nRain probability: {{ $json.rain_probability }}%\\n\\nCreate a day-by-day itinerary for the entire trip.\\n\\nFor every day include:\\n- Morning activity\\n- Afternoon activity\\n- Evening activity\\n- Suggested food experience\\n- Approximate daily cost\\n\\nAlso provide:\\n1. Estimated total trip cost\\n2. Budget remaining\\n3. Travel tips\\n4. Weather precautions\\n5. Packing suggestions\\n\\nKeep the itinerary realistic and within the customer's budget.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
